tish cyrus and billy ray cyrus have  reportedly called it quits after nearly  30 years of marriage with tmz reporting  that tisch filed for divorce last week  with the court in tennessee according to  court documents the pair have not lived  together since february of 2020 with  tisch citing irreconcilable differences  as the grounds for their divorce in  addition tisch is reportedly asking for  all marital assets be divided equally  between the two now this is not the  first time the couple have filed for  divorce in 2010 billy ray filed to end  the marriage but the split was called  off then in 2013 tisch filed for divorce  but it was once again called off soon  after as we know the couple share five  children together including miley and  noah cyrus their youngest child being  over the age of 22 means that custody  will not be a factor in the divorce  proceedings the couple were last seen  publicly together back in 2020 and some  fans speculated about the state of their  marriage over the holidays when billy  ray was not featured in family photos  and videos that miley had posted to  social media
 

